    {
      "id": "song-795",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "玉楼春",
      "subtitle": "玉烛光明正旦好",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "玉烛光明正旦好。\n斗柄东回春太早。\n岭寒犹锁去年梅，江暖新催今岁草。\n蜀国熙熙冬令杪。\n更喜寿阳新梦觉。\n玉杯齐举乐音谐，遥想金阶天仗晓。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "935a0077817450ada68953404bd114030068f890af24ab5952346103460ed022",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-795--935a0077817450ada68953404bd114030068f890af24ab5952346103460ed022.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-796",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "玉楼春",
      "subtitle": "风解池冰蝉翅薄",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "风解池冰蝉翅薄。\n庭树枝枯笼翠萼。\n背寒迎暖起犹慵，闲卷珠帘凭画阁。\n晴景融融烟漠漠。\n天际行人乖信约。\n病容先怯见春来，长到恁时添瘦削。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "52d0fd755ba74fa80b42efa056c5b5ce0a500eb95431805a2e2404b240efb8c0",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-796--52d0fd755ba74fa80b42efa056c5b5ce0a500eb95431805a2e2404b240efb8c0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-797",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "玉楼春",
      "subtitle": "晴景融融春色浅",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "晴景融融春色浅。\n落尽梅花千万片。\n小池冰解水纹生，消息未闻梁上燕。\n楼倚轻寒风力软。\n目断孤云天自远。\n又还依旧去年时，寂寞病容人怪见。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "80e4f7e9621db96c40cd9735d332082d07a4a6d04730f4fe21c43b3004194dab",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-797--80e4f7e9621db96c40cd9735d332082d07a4a6d04730f4fe21c43b3004194dab.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-798",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "玉楼春",
      "subtitle": "三月牡丹呈艳态",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "三月牡丹呈艳态。\n壮观人间春世界。\n鲛绡玉槛作扃栊，淹雅洞中王母队。\n不奈风吹兼日㬠。\n国貌天香无物赛。\n直须共赏莫轻孤，回首万金何处买。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e3e0cf3dd8beaeeb9e4f64b002675c48698c70c4ebcd72b16d3649654c3d674d",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-798--e3e0cf3dd8beaeeb9e4f64b002675c48698c70c4ebcd72b16d3649654c3d674d.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-799",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "玉楼春",
      "subtitle": "纶命忽从天上至",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "纶命忽从天上至。\n便绾兵权辞漕计。\n汉廷起草旧郎官，蜀部坐筹新将帅。\n红旆碧幢春色里。\n娇马嘶风花片坠。\n送行今日短亭中，恼乱故人须尽醉。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "653d84ae422d8b192aef8db0b401c08c3b734a7be9bd6a64bd7f2e525574aacb",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-799--653d84ae422d8b192aef8db0b401c08c3b734a7be9bd6a64bd7f2e525574aacb.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-800",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "玉楼春",
      "subtitle": "春景抛人无处问",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "春景抛人无处问。\n多谢石榴花又喷。\n茜罗揉出碎英繁，红蜡缕成香萼润。\n血色新裙羞莫近。\n密叶柔条相间衬。\n雨馀寂寞假山傍，乡国尚遥西海信。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "6c11e96d6752a09661f452e24795366d652c6e6744d2898b36897cee16002783",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-800--6c11e96d6752a09661f452e24795366d652c6e6744d2898b36897cee16002783.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-801",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "玉楼春",
      "subtitle": "三月初三春渐老",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "三月初三春渐老。\n遍地残花风暗扫。\n命俦啸侣拥笙歌，临水泛觞游宴好。\n浮利浮名何足道。\n丽景芳时须笑傲。\n今年不似去年欢，云海路长天杳杳。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "b47f24e12796a7a271be81546fde2575d5ae80a72d93a5c592750867f9724038",
      "estimatedOutput": 738,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-801--b47f24e12796a7a271be81546fde2575d5ae80a72d93a5c592750867f9724038.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-802",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "更漏子",
      "subtitle": "雪肌轻花脸薄愁",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "雪肌轻，花脸薄。\n愁困不忺梳掠。\n眉翠袅，眼波长。\n偎人言语香。\n看难厌，怜不足。\n苦恨别离何速。\n珠树远，彩鸾孤。\n今生重见无。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "57a41616f9ce7bea9471b31572e75ed7712bcec9c54ab52e2bad9b3417077aa0",
      "estimatedOutput": 730,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-802--57a41616f9ce7bea9471b31572e75ed7712bcec9c54ab52e2bad9b3417077aa0.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-803",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "更漏子",
      "subtitle": "脸如花花不笑双",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "脸如花，花不笑。\n双脸胜花能笑。\n肌似玉，玉非温。\n肌温胜玉温。\n既相逢，情不重。\n何似当初休共。\n情既重，却分飞。\n争如不见伊。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f31728040cfa18d7a4e184468372d4151d81b2c717190f2b16620e57d5edecac",
      "estimatedOutput": 730,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-803--f31728040cfa18d7a4e184468372d4151d81b2c717190f2b16620e57d5edecac.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-804",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "更漏子",
      "subtitle": "镂金环连玉珥颗",
      "author": "杜安世",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "镂金环，连玉珥。\n颗颗蚌蛤相缀。\n偎粉面，映莲腮。\n露浓花正开。\n冷光凝，员影重。\n几度偷期摇动。\n山枕上，恐人知。\n摘嫌纤手迟。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "0240a14beeaf2f9cf7458fca61dc967a341475d5a9df4b539431f5f5f734ef9f",
